# MadGraph5 batch script: p p > l+ l- j QCD=2 QED=2 at a fixed scale.
#
# Same process content as pp_to_llj_qcd2_qed2 (identical generate line and
# multiparticle definitions, so the proc card differs only in the output
# directory name); the run card differs in four places:
#
#   - fixed_ren_scale / fixed_fac_scale1 / fixed_fac_scale2 = True, all three
#     scales at m_Z. The dynamical default (dynamical_scale_choice = -1) needs
#     the general kT clustering for a 2 -> 3, which coupling::scales refuses
#     rather than approximates; a constant scale takes the branch that has a
#     closed form, so this run's per-event SCALUP / <rscale> / <pdfrwt> can be
#     replayed exactly.
#   - pdlabel = lhapdf with lhaid 247000 (NNPDF23_lo_as_0130_qed). The
#     MG-internal nn23lo1 of the dynamical runs is not an LHAPDF6 grid, so it
#     cannot be read by this crate's PDF layer; 247000 is the same set the
#     Drell-Yan cross-section reference already uses.
#   - mmll = 50, above the region where the Drell-Yan comparison carries a
#     standing few-percent discrepancy, so a cross section gated against this
#     run does not inherit it.
#
# Everything else (13 TeV, ptj 20, ptl 10, etaj 5, etal 2.5, drll = drjl = 0.4,
# use_syst) is left at the values the dynamical run used.
generate p p > l+ l- j QCD=2 QED=2
output pp_to_llj_fixed -nojpeg
launch
  set ebeam1 6500
  set ebeam2 6500
  set fixed_ren_scale True
  set fixed_fac_scale1 True
  set fixed_fac_scale2 True
  set scale 91.188
  set dsqrt_q2fact1 91.188
  set dsqrt_q2fact2 91.188
  set pdlabel lhapdf
  set lhaid 247000
  set mmll 50
  done
